ng, Satisfying, Relaxing, Competitive, Physics, Challenge, Speedrun, +1 Speed","path":"/game/109578395590751-1-speed-brick-escape","slug":"109578395590751-1-speed-brick-escape","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7c6d3d94f1272b8472dace517e48097a96676b8c2efb020dde877c128fb568f1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5986289bb789d8d1f398576ca4465374/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":35,"visitor":48874839,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-06-23T11:11:08.659Z","creator":{"name":"+1 Industry","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6416498845,"name":"[CL] Facility Roleplay","desc":"12 Deadly Virus Strains. 8 Teams. 1 Facility. \n\nPICK YOUR TEAM:\n\n🛡️ CENTUM SECURITY - lock it down, hold the line\n🧪 HEALTH & RESEARCH - experiment on Subjects, save humankind with cures\n☣️ BIOHAZARD CONTAINMENT UNIT - the last line of defense when the breaches occur\n🎭 OSIRIS COLLECTIVE - break in, steal the strains, go undercover and watch the facility burn\n...+ 4 MORE teams, each with their own purpose.\n\nFIGHT THE BIO UNKNOWN\n\n🔥 New updates & live events all year\n🎁 Daily Rewards\n💸 Roblox Plus = PASSIVE INCOME\n👍 Like + Join the group = bonus Cash & XP\n\n☣️ What will YOU do...? ☣️","path":"/game/6416498845-facility-roleplay","slug":"6416498845-facility-roleplay","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ea05700d4dd7a9c0004854398a60e14f342f2e7a05eece27f41f429213c7679d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a9f1a7187d8a4d79e3a8c6a1bf2fcda2/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":35,"visitor":17303445,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-26T13:19:49.456Z","creator":{"name":"Facility Roleplay [ConX Studios]","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9585537847,"name":"SHADOVIS RPG","desc":"RPG game where you collect loot, buy gear, explore the world traversing through 7 different realms to become the ULTIMATE warrior. Weapons are very unique in this game and have special moves based on their type.\n\nCollect Cubits across the map to gain permanent XP power-ups. There are over 200 to find.\n\nSupport the game for more updates. Releasing a new code at 125K likes.\n\nHave fun playing!\n\nUPDATE:\n* Added the final boss.\n* Use code '100klikes' for a strong item! Can be fused into something even more powerful...\n\nLeft-Click to Attack\nQ to Roll\nShift to Sprint \nE / R / F for Skill keys","path":"/game/9585537847-shadovis-rpg","slug":"9585537847-shadovis-rpg","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/41775d8a8cff5380d7ee09ff11f0a236d3b06a838a746d5e7d57ff79444941c8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e440c93a57e9a34a7c6c4977c7055217/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":35,"visitor":44223647,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-11T08:10:37.351Z","creator":{"name":"The Elemental","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":11,"freeCount":11,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":3}},{"id":32990482,"name":"Flood Escape: Classic","desc":"Locked in a flooding facility, you and your team must work together to push buttons, find the way out, crack the code and escape before the flood takes you!\n\nFlood Escape Classic started development in September 2011, and is what kickstarted the Flood Escape series.\n\nFEC persisted through many of Roblox's fundamental changes; Mobile Support, Dynamic Lighting, Filtering Enabled and many more.\n\nWhile the game doesn't get updated often now due to focus on FE2, FEC's continued community and player count shows that the game continues to offer a solid experience for obby enthusiasts.\n\nFlood Escape © Crazyblox Games 2011 - 2024","path":"/game/32990482-flood-escape-classic","slug":"32990482-flood-escape-classic","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/affd004ea8124269b4229e83cf5278d583d7b06e560e9eb0652c09eb94e6598d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-56cf0729f152ddb75602b92b0c5af435/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":35,"visitor":583697971,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11